            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "lutzflcat"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Served over a grilled ham steak; not too sweet with just enough cloves to make it interesting. A quick go-to weeknight entree for us is to throw a smoked pork chop on the grill, and this sauce would be a good way to style it up a bit. Thanks for sharing your recipe.",
            "datePublished": "2023-03-07T11:25:05.478Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Marsha in Asheville"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Made 1/2 recipe. It is to die for. I use to make a recipe from my mother that we had when I was growing up. It was brown sugar and raisins but this recipe is going to take over. I love the pineapple flavor. I had no problem with congealing and I made it an hour before consuming and then reheated to use for dinner. YUMMO!",
            "datePublished": "2022-12-27T14:59:15.687Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Hope Blackford"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I didn't have 2 cups of pineapple juice. I combined the juice from a small can of pineapple, a small can of mandarin oranges, and a can of peaches (adding about 1/8 cup water to complete the 2 cups). I brought to a boil, then simmered with small bubbles for 10 mins. I applied it to a ham slice which I baked at 350 for about 15-20 mins. It is really, really good. Not too sweet, and definitely not tangy.",
            "datePublished": "2022-06-29T21:47:56.808Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
              "ratingValue": "5"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Virginia Hull Welch"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Followed recipe exactly. Tangy/sweet. Delicious! I'll be making this again and again.",
            "datePublished": "2019-04-16T21:57:57.280Z"
